                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 22pt;line-height: 27.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;">
</p><p style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 27.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">党的二十届三中全会指出，教育、科技、人才是中国式现代化的基础性、战略性支撑。北京大学信息科学技术学院响应“拔尖计划”，组织了2025年“全国优秀中学生信息学冬季体验营”，于1月14日</span><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">-</span><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">15日在绍兴一中教育集团龙山书院</span><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">盛大</span><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">举办。</span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 27.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">| 会聚英才，育梦北大 |</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 27.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1月14日上午10:00，冬令营开营仪式在绍兴龙山书院演艺中心二楼剧场举行。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">北京大学信息科学技术学院党委书记严敏杰，北京大学信息科学技术学院副院长陆俊林</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">北京大学信息科学技术学院院长助理张勤健，绍兴市教育局副局长、绍兴一中党委书记丁初效，绍兴一中党委副书记、校长蒋明，绍兴一中副校长俞奇弘、杨佩琼、冯王亮，绍兴一中信息学</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">奥林匹克竞</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">赛总教练陈合力出席开营仪式。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">仪式</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">由陆俊林主持。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 27.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">蒋明代表绍兴一中教育集团向北京大学和</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">与会</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">领导、专家表示衷心感谢，向</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">全国各地</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">远道而来的优秀学子和领队老师表示热烈欢迎。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 27.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">严敏杰介绍了</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">北京大学信息科学技术学院</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在信息学科建设方面的</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">突出</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">成就，并强调了此次体验营对于</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">北京大学创新</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人才培养的重要意义。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 27.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">开营仪式</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">上</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">还展示了北京大学在第48届国际大学生程序设计竞赛ICPC全球总决赛中获得世界冠军的代表队风采。严敏杰向冠军队伍</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">成员</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的中学教练颁发了感谢信，以表彰他们对</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">北京大学</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人才培养的贡献。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 27.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">陆俊林就本次冬季体验营的注意事项进行了详细说明。</span></p><p style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 27.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 楷体;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">| 铿锵奋进，逐梦青云 |</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 27.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">开营仪式后，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">体验营举办了</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">专家前沿</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">专题讲座，并先后进行两次上机测试。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 27.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">本次</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">冬季体验营为</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">全国</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">优秀中学生提供了一个学习</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">和</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">交流的平台，也为我国信息科学教育的发展注入了新的活力，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">有利于</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">全面推进素质教育实施和创新人才培养。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 27.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">青年兴则国家兴。希望本次冬季体验营能够成为各位</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">参营</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">同学</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学习成长</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的一个里程碑，开启信息学探索之旅的新篇章。祝福各位参营同学在未来勇攀</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">科技</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高峰，为</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">国家强盛</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">贡献自己的力量。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 27.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/1/202501161405376311.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202501161405376311.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/1/202501161405378357.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202501161405378357.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/1/202501161405355773.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202501161405355773.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/1/202501161405363632.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202501161405363632.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/1/202501161405362401.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202501161405362401.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/1/202501161405360209.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202501161405360209.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/1/202501161405395533.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202501161405395533.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/1/202501161405376648.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202501161405376648.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/1/202501161405381957.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202501161405381957.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/1/202501161405388418.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202501161405388418.jpg" /></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 27.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span>
</p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 27.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: right;text-indent: 0.44in;">
</p>
    
